{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43169","headline":"晚霁登汝南大云阁 · 贾彦璋","name":"晚霁登汝南大云阁","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"禅宫新歇雨，香阁晚登临。\n邑树晴光起，川苗佳气深。\n水包城下岸，云细郢中岑。\n自叹牵卑日，聊开望远心。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贾彦璋","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43169.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43169","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}